{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 14 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">2D→3D 与神经场：表示能力、投影一致性和不可辨识性</span><span class=\"lang-en\">2D-to-3D &amp; Neural Fields</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_128_pixelnerf-title\">pixelNeRF</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">pixelNeRF 将每个 3D 点与其投影像素的 CNN 特征绑定，使 NeRF 从单场景优化器变为跨场景条件模型。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Conditions a coordinate NeRF MLP on pixel-aligned 2D CNN feature vectors projected from 1 or a few input views, turning NeRF from a per-scene optimizer into a feed-forward cross-scene prior.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">一张或少量带相机位姿的参考图像，以及目标相机射线</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">1 to K calibrated input images + query 3D point x projected into each input view's camera coordinates</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">目标视角 RGB 图像和隐式密度/辐射场</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Feed-forward novel-view rendering and 3D volumetric density field from sparse views</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.4</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2021/html/Yu_pixelNeRF_Neural_Radiance_Fields_From_One_or_Few_Images_CVPR_2021_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_128_pixelnerf')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_128_pixelnerf')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"pixelNeRF original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/6eb4e482023af66574c3.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.4</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_128_pixelnerf', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_128_pixelnerf\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_128_pixelnerf')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_128_pixelnerf', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_128_pixelnerf\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">带 pose 的参考图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">pose</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">单视图或少视图，可来自此前未见场景</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests 1 to k calibrated input images + query 3d point x projected into each input view's camera coordinates and prepares initial tensor representations (pose).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"单视图或少视图，可来自此前未见场景\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests 1 to k calibrated input images + query 3d point x projected into each input view's camera coordinates and prepares initial tensor representations (pose).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"带 pose 的参考图像\" data-node-name-en=\"pose\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_128_pixelnerf', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">带 pose 的参考图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">pose</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">单视图或少视图，可来自此前未见场景</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests 1 to k calibrated input images + query 3d point x projected into each input view's camera coordinates and prepares initial tensor representations (pose).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"为每张参考图像生成保留空间位置的特征图\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes CNN image encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"共享 CNN image encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"CNN image encoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_128_pixelnerf', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">共享 CNN image encoder</span><span class=\"lang-en\">CNN image encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">为每张参考图像生成保留空间位置的特征图</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes CNN image encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"沿每个目标像素射线采样 x 与 view direction d\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs objective 3D sample points within the core pixel aligned feature conditioned nerf computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"目标射线 3D sample points\" data-node-name-en=\"objective 3D sample points\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_128_pixelnerf', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">目标射线 3D sample points</span><span class=\"lang-en\">objective 3D sample points</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">沿每个目标像素射线采样 x 与 view direction d</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs objective 3D sample points within the core pixel aligned feature conditioned nerf computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"把 3D 点投到每张参考图，读取 pixel-aligned feature\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs projection sampling within the core pixel aligned feature conditioned nerf computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"相机投影与双线性采样\" data-node-name-en=\"projection sampling\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_128_pixelnerf', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">相机投影与双线性采样</span><span class=\"lang-en\">projection sampling</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">把 3D 点投到每张参考图，读取 pixel-aligned feature</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs projection sampling within the core pixel aligned feature conditioned nerf computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"联合位置编码、方向和像素特征预测 density 与 color\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Feature-conditioned NeRF MLP within the core pixel aligned feature conditioned nerf computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Feature-conditioned NeRF MLP\" data-node-name-en=\"Feature-conditioned NeRF MLP\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_128_pixelnerf', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Feature-conditioned NeRF MLP</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">联合位置编码、方向和像素特征预测 density 与 color</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Feature-conditioned NeRF MLP within the core pixel aligned feature conditioned nerf computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"对各参考视图的中间特征平均/汇聚\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs multi-view feature aggregation within the core pixel aligned feature conditioned nerf computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"多视图 feature aggregation\" data-node-name-en=\"multi-view feature aggregation\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_128_pixelnerf', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">多视图 feature aggregation</span><span class=\"lang-en\">multi-view feature aggregation</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">对各参考视图的中间特征平均/汇聚</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs multi-view feature aggregation within the core pixel aligned feature conditioned nerf computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"按透射率和密度沿射线积分颜色\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Differentiable volume rendering to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"Differentiable volume rendering\" data-node-name-en=\"Differentiable volume rendering\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_128_pixelnerf', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Differentiable volume rendering</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">按透射率和密度沿射线积分颜色</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Differentiable volume rendering to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"跨场景一次 encoder 前向后即可条件化渲染\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces feed-forward novel-view rendering and 3d volumetric density field from sparse views via Novel-View Rendering.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"新视角输出\" data-node-name-en=\"Novel-View Rendering\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_128_pixelnerf', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">新视角输出</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Novel-View Rendering</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">跨场景一次 encoder 前向后即可条件化渲染</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces feed-forward novel-view rendering and 3d volumetric density field from sparse views via Novel-View Rendering.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"pixelNeRF Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 像素对齐图像特征条件化的辐射场渲染</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Pixel-Aligned View-Space CNN Feature Conditioning of Continuous Radiance Fields</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"pixelNeRF：核心公式 · 像素对齐图像特征条件化的辐射场渲染\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"128\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"23.290543pt\" pre